sequenceDiagram
  participant I as A2-003 Incident Engine
  participant E as A2-005 Experiment/Shadow
  participant G as A2-006 Privilege Gateway
  participant A as Qualified Actuator
  participant S as A2-008 Store
  I->>E: attribution + outcome baseline + gaps
  E->>E: paired/repeated evidence + thermal/control conditions
  alt uncertain / no repeatable user benefit
    E-->>I: NO_OP / more evidence / guidance
  else candidate qualifies for canary
    E->>G: typed CandidateAction + qualification ref
    G->>G: exact device/firmware + bounds + rollback recheck
    alt stale / unsafe / unqualified
      G-->>E: REJECT
    else qualified
      G->>G: capture SafetySnapshot + journal
      G->>A: one bounded operation
      A-->>G: read-back
      alt postcondition + user outcome guard pass
        G->>S: verified canary outcome
        G-->>E: VERIFIED_SUCCESS
      else failure / regression / controller fight
        G->>A: rollback
        A-->>G: rollback read-back
        G->>S: failure + qualification suspension
        G-->>E: ROLLED_BACK / CRITICAL_FAULT if unresolved
      end
    end
  end
